  "job_B15.8.469_20260920_210339": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00c6rest of \u00fean hlawe into theoburnan, nor\u00f0 anglang teoburnan to Cuforda. Of Cuforda to w\u00e6tlinga str\u00e6te, east andlang str\u00e6te to \u00feam setle. Of \u00feam setle on hinan croftes ge m\u00e6re, \u00feanon sou\u00f0 to \u00fean ealdan str\u00e6te. Of \u00feare str\u00e6te eft to watlinga str\u00e6te, andlang strate to \u00feare ealden werhrode. \u00deanan to \u00feas ealder mannes ge m\u00e6re, \u00feanan su\u00f0 rihte to akemannestr\u00e6te. West andlang str\u00e6te to cyrringe, \u00feanon eft on \u00feone hlawe..",
